{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1370113-looking-for-another-player-or-two-for-a-2-5e-homebrew-game","id":1370113,"title":"Looking for another player or two for a 2.5e/homebrew game!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-24T12:07:07-08:00","id":1370113,"title":"Looking for another player or two for a 2.5e/homebrew game!","content":"<span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">We have a long-spanning <b><u>Exalted</u></b> game that's moving onto a new chapter - we're going into Rathess for a bit of a combined mission, trying to re-enlighten some Dragonkings, do some ruins-delving, and resurrect a fallen god (plus whatever else comes up along the way!).</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">We also have an overarching metaplot that's sort of shaken out to be Lunars vs. The Realm for domination of the southeastern Threshold, but the Rathess chapter came up when &quot;someone&quot; managed to piss off an influential god and, long story short, it's now our main focus of the moment.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This is a more narrative-focused game, lots of storytelling and roleplaying. If you like character drama more than flashy combos, this is the game for you! I like to say that it has the heart of a play-by-post, but the pace of a voice game (well, it is a voice game).</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Right now, we're recruiting for the following splats/character types:</span></span><ul><li>Lunars (Using either TAW mod or 2.5e if you somehow prefer it)</li> <li>Dragonbloods (you will be an older Dragonblood so as to keep pace with the Celestial Exalts)</li> <li>Godbloods</li> <li>Dragon Kings (wow!!)</li> </ul><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">We're located in EST and right now the game time is 7pm-12am Friday nights, however, that may be somewhat flexible.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">Feel free to post here or DM me if you have any questions, we have an active Discord that I can also send an invite to.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">If you are new to Exalted or don't know much about the rules, that's actually a plus - so don't be shy. Creativity and serious role-playing are the only things we need to see.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1066,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","user":"The Despot","date":". 02-24-2020, 04:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","name":"The Despot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T09:43:38-08:00","id":1370585,"title":"","content":"Obsidian Portal:<br /> <a href=\"https://thedragonsshattered.obsidianportal.com/characters\" target=\"_blank\">https://thedragonsshattered.obsidian...com/characters</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","name":"The Despot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T22:00:53-07:00","id":1386906,"title":"","content":"Hey there! I have been dying to play 2.5 for ever now. Do you still have an opening?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"